et lost and sometimes stubborn as they learn how to walk.\nBut you'll be able to save all the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(2)1440_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "843670026323221", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_843670029656554_4170918606599011011_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UT_kYhu562MQ7kNvwEx9k5s&_nc_oc=AdkwYjaUE1vSunDm_sdXw9uVWCyhlm2nU5nCeGtfchKQfDF5MUSeddB2ofeLYK6xZCo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsJNTStFSCt5GTwodIj7A_KHHkIvBwla4gnm8a2quEPew&oe=699EFB9F"}, {"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(\uc2dc\uc5482)2560_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "627571058261409", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_627571061594742_7128199620299863828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pAIFe9QY6KQQ7kNvwHB7n50&_nc_oc=AdnuFtZ6YESFy0_5u60y5NP2n_Ayl4fplcXj5eMq-Bx6cj6kUFEpNB6PInaoYs-xSEs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvuadMNa1cYz-ziJ2lKkyWtuvx2Jh3PVYq-lEso9zg6QQ&oe=699EF787"}, {"file_name": "app_logo.png", "id": "583935226146634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223477_583935232813300_935540870816570877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LynItwa1-qgQ7kNvwFPvLbH&_nc_oc=AdmCdr5vN2gvtrpCuQ8gp8eaGqZBUJ11qL9lUV8Ij4619PaVDRsWpBDxH1hv1XGn0po&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftZJhU2JYxkJ-13tEDLTlXbDHh9CUvm7jLNsvxjRXWCbg&oe=699EFBD7"}, {"file_name": "